full-query: "You are designing an application that contains protected health information. Security and compliance requirements for your application mandate that all protected health information in the application use encryption at rest and in transit. The application uses a three-tier architecture where data flows through the load balancer and is stored on Amazon EBS volumes for processing and the results are stored in Amazon S3 using the AWS SDK."
